id: grenade
name: Grenade
kind: gear
tags: tech
craftDC: Qualified
# "When you create this Basic Item, record your Scholarship Modifier." Recorded when it is
# given, the way the Bomb's is, and editable on the Item.
records: scholarship
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Thrown with the Throw Maneuver: a Minor Sphere around the target, the recorded
  Scholarship Modifier as the Damage Attribute, and the Grenade is gone afterwards.
text: >
  Grenade [Tech]: A hand-held explosive that you lob at an enemy.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: When you create this Basic Item, record your Scholarship Modifier. When using
  the Throw Maneuver, that Attacking Maneuver has a Minor Sphere AoE (centered on the initial
  target of this Maneuver) and the Damage Attribute for that Attacking Maneuver is the
  Scholarship Modifier recorded when this Basic Item was created, but this Basic Item is
  destroyed after concluding the Maneuver.

---

# --- What is built -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The recorded Scholarship Modifier: taken off the character when they are given it, shown
# and editable on the Item.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Everything the Grenade does happens inside the Throw Maneuver, and there is no Throw
# Maneuver in this system yet. When it arrives, throwing a Grenade with it is: a Minor Sphere
# AoE centred on the one it was thrown at, the recorded Modifier standing in for the Damage
# Attribute - the Bomb's `damageAttribute`, already carried on an attack - and the Grenade
# removed from the character once the Maneuver is over.
